# Most Common Function Types Used in Playwright Frameworks

| Function Type   | Real-Time Usage   |
| --------------- | ----------------- |
| Parameters      | dynamic test data |
| Return types    | validations       |
| Optional params | flexible methods  |
| Default params  | timeout/browser   |
| Rest params     | multiple elements |

